  ! Take over the repository /srv/demo-foreign as a local stack folder?         
                                                                                
  Yes makes the changes listed below.                                           
                                                                                
    folder: /srv/demo-foreign                                                   
    case: local (a repository without a remote, deployed as it is)              
                                                                                
  Foreign project                                                               
    project: legacy-blog                                                        
    compose files (labels): /srv/demo-foreign/compose.yaml                      
    env files (labels): /srv/demo-foreign/.env                                  
                                                                                
  Warning                                                                       
